{"parentUuid":null,"isSidechain":true,"promptId":"6fa20b73-a995-4ae4-b928-344e193a8ce4","agentId":"a062ff6396a691d74","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":"Audit R13 调研 agent `a8a448561dbacf07c` 关于 OpenEvolve / AlphaEvolve 半年进展的 claim 是否真实。这次是 follow-up source-verify audit，跟 R5 shared_tree / R11 presolve_extract 同样模式（agent 报告即使引用 URL 也可能错）。\n\n## 项目背景\n\n终末地工业规划器路线图 P2 #14 \"AlphaEvolve cut-evolution PoC\"。R13 agent 报告说 OpenEvolve 半年内成熟，建议把 R10 估的\"1 周 PoC\"缩到 2-3 day。这条 verdict 直接影响下一步 PoC 选择。\n\n## R13 agent 的关键 claim（需要 audit）\n\n读 transcript 文件：`/home/zhuran24/claude-pj/zmd/docs/research/agent_transcripts/a8a448561dbacf07c.output`\n\n(1) **OpenEvolve v0.2.27 release 2026-03-18，late beta**\n(2) **半年内 5 个迭代版本（v0.2.23 起每月一发），dacite 配置简化、env-var API key、CUDA 内存管理、确定性 seed、event-based early stopping 已落地**\n(3) **任何 OpenAI-compatible API 支持，v0.2.26 修了 Anthropic 参数 bug, circle packing 案例直接用 Gemini-Flash-2.0 + Claude-3.7-Sonnet 双模型 ensemble 拿 SOTA**\n(4) **TSP example v0.2.26 加了 large-codebase 模式**\n(5) **AlphaEvolve 正式 paper arXiv 2506.13131 (2025-06)**\n(6) **DeepSeek V3 $0.27/$1.10 per M tok，500 iter ≈ $5**\n(7) **Claude Opus 4.7 $5/$25 per M tok**\n(8) **Gemini 2.5 Flash $0.30/$2.50 per M tok ≈ $10-15 / 500 iter**\n(9) **LLM-LNS ICML 2025 spotlight 实测打过 Gurobi/SCIP + GNN&GBDT 基线**\n\n## Audit 任务\n\n**用 WebFetch 直接查（不要凭训练数据，不要 trust transcript URL 没 actual fetch）**：\n\n1. **OpenEvolve PyPI**: 访问 `https://pypi.org/project/openevolve/`\n   - 当前版本号 + release 日期\n   - 是否真有 v0.2.27, v0.2.26, v0.2.25 版本\n\n2. **OpenEvolve GitHub releases**: 访问 `https://github.com/codelion/openevolve/releases`\n   - tag list + release notes\n   - dacite/CUDA/seed/event-based 这些功能 commit 是否真存在\n\n3. **AlphaEvolve arXiv 2506.13131**: 访问 `https://arxiv.org/abs/2506.13131`\n   - paper 标题、作者、abstract\n   - 是否真是 DeepMind AlphaEvolve\n\n4. **API 价格**：访问对应官方页面 verify\n   - DeepSeek V3 价格: `https://api-docs.deepseek.com/quick_start/pricing`\n   - Claude API 当前价格: `https://www.anthropic.com/pricing`（看 Sonnet/Opus 列）\n   - Gemini API: `https://ai.google.dev/gemini-api/docs/pricing`\n\n5. **LLM-LNS ICML 2025**: WebSearch \"LLM-LNS ICML 2025\"\n   - paper 真存在？是 spotlight？\n   - \"实测打过 Gurobi/SCIP\" claim 是 paper abstract 还是 agent 推断\n\n每条 claim 标 CONFIRMED / PARTIALLY / REFUTED。\n\n## 输出格式（不超过 600 字，中文）\n\n```\n## 9 条 claim audit 结果\n| # | claim | verdict | 备注 |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| 1 | OpenEvolve v0.2.27 release 2026-03-18 | CONFIRMED/PARTIALLY/REFUTED | URL/数据 |\n| 2 | 5 个迭代版本 + 4 个功能落地 | ... | ... |\n| ... | | | |\n\n## 关键修正\n[列 transcript 哪条数字 / 描述错了]\n\n## 路线图修订建议\n- P2 #14 工时 2-3 day claim: 仍有效 / 需要修订\n- API 成本 $5-50: 仍有效 / 实际 ...\n- 立即可做 verdict: 维持 / 改 ...\n\n## verdict\nCONFIRMED (Agent 报告基本可信) / PARTIALLY (X 条错) / REFUTED (主要 claim 翻盘)\n```\n\n## 操作准则\n\n- **必须** WebFetch 实际 URL（PyPI / arXiv / 官方价格页）\n- transcript 引用的 URL 也要重新 fetch (不能假设 transcript 里的 URL 内容真是 transcript 描述的那样)\n- 简洁\n\n开始。"},"uuid":"422bdda1-6fb7-4512-a083-bc16e8d1c540","timestamp":"2026-05-09T23:49:59.596Z","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/home/zhuran24/claude-pj/zmd","sessionId":"7db7f276-a2bf-4762-b9b8-bb35f8cf3fb9","version":"2.1.138","gitBranch":"master","slug":"squishy-zooming-sphinx"}
{"parentUuid":"422bdda1-6fb7-4512-a083-bc16e8d1c540","isSidechain":true,"agentId":"a062ff6396a691d74","attachment":{"type":"deferred_tools_delta","addedNames":["CronCreate","CronDelete","CronList","EnterWorktree","ExitWorktree","Monitor","NotebookEdit","PushNotification","RemoteTrigger","TaskCreate","TaskGet","TaskList","TaskStop","TaskUpdate","WebFetch","WebSearch"],"addedLines":["CronCreate","CronDelete","CronList","EnterWorktree","ExitWorktree","Monitor","NotebookEdit","PushNotification","RemoteTrigger","TaskCreate","TaskGet","TaskList","TaskStop","TaskUpdate","WebFetch","WebSearch"],"removedNames":[],"readdedNames":[]},"type":"attachment","uuid":"0382eb3e-f92b-4b95-bfe4-af890814f56b","timestamp":"2026-05-09T23:49:59.598Z","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/home/zhuran24/claude-pj/zmd","sessionId":"7db7f276-a2bf-4762-b9b8-bb35f8cf3fb9","version":"2.1.138","gitBranch":"master","slug":"squishy-zooming-sphinx"}
{"parentUuid":"0382eb3e-f92b-4b95-bfe4-af890814f56b","isSidechain":true,"agentId":"a062ff6396a691d74","attachment":{"type":"skill_listing","content":"- update-config: Use this skill to configure the Claude Code harness via settings.json. Automated behaviors (\"from now on when X\", \"each time X\", \"whenever X\", \"before/after X\") require hooks configured in settings.json - the harness executes these, not Claude, so memory/preferences cannot fulfill them. Also use for: permissions (\"allow X\", \"add permission\", \"move permission to\"), env vars (\"set X=Y\"), hook troubleshooting, or any changes to settings.json/settings.local.json files. Examples: \"allow npm commands\", \"add bq permission to global settings\", \"move permission to user settings\", \"set DEBUG=true\", \"when claude stops show X\". For simple settings like theme/model, suggest the /config command.\n- keybindings-help: Use when the user wants to customize keyboard shortcuts, rebind keys, add chord bindings, or modify ~/.claude/keybindings.json. Examples: \"rebind ctrl+s\", \"add a chord shortcut\", \"change the submit key\", \"customize keybindings\".\n- simplify: Review changed code for reuse, quality, and efficiency, then fix any issues found.\n- fewer-permission-prompts: Scan your transcripts for common read-only Bash and MCP tool calls, then add a prioritized allowlist to project .claude/settings.json to reduce permission prompts.\n- loop: Run a prompt or slash command on a recurring interval (e.g. /loop 5m /foo). Omit the interval to let the model self-pace. - When the user wants to set up a recurring task, poll for status, or run something repeatedly on an interval (e.g. \"check the deploy every 5 minutes\", \"keep running /babysit-prs\"). Do NOT invoke for one-off tasks.\n- schedule: Create, update, list, or run scheduled remote agents (routines) that execute on a cron schedule. - When the user wants to schedule a recurring remote agent, set up automated tasks, create a cron job for Claude Code, or manage their scheduled agents/routines. Also use when the user wants a one-time scheduled run (\"run this once at 3pm\", \"remind me to check X tomorrow\").\n- claude-api: Build, debug, and optimize Claude API / Anthropic SDK apps. Apps built with this skill should include prompt caching. Also handles migrating existing Claude API code between Claude model versions (4.5 → 4.6, 4.6 → 4.7, retired-model replacements).\nTRIGGER when: code imports `anthropic`/`@anthropic-ai/sdk`; user asks for the Claude API, Anthropic SDK, or Managed Agents; user adds/modifies/tunes a Claude feature (caching, thinking, compaction, tool use, batch, files, citations, memory) or model (Opus/Sonnet/Haiku) in a file; questions about prompt caching / cache hit rate in an Anthropic SDK project.\nSKIP: file imports `openai`/other-provider SDK, filename like `*-openai.py`/`*-generic.py`, provider-neutral code, general programming/ML.\n- init: Initialize a new CLAUDE.md file with codebase documentation\n- review: Review a pull request\n- security-review: Complete a security review of the pending changes on the current branch","skillCount":10,"isInitial":true},"type":"attachment","uuid":"220b1510-3018-418e-b794-591e4f77b2e7","timestamp":"2026-05-09T23:49:59.598Z","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/home/zhuran24/claude-pj/zmd","sessionId":"7db7f276-a2bf-4762-b9b8-bb35f8cf3fb9","version":"2.1.138","gitBranch":"master","slug":"squishy-zooming-sphinx"}
