{"parentUuid":"0aa0886e-dfe6-4df0-9ec7-91acf75c31a0","isSidechain":true,"promptId":"6fa20b73-a995-4ae4-b928-344e193a8ce4","agentId":"a062ff6396a691d74","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01DfQgUfnPmPXuX3pLsRAhS1","type":"tool_result","content":"Web search results for query: \"Claude Opus 4.7 API pricing per million tokens 2026\"\n\nLinks: [{\"title\":\"Claude Opus 4.7 Pricing 2026: The Real Cost Story Behind the “Unchanged” Price Tag\",\"url\":\"https://www.finout.io/blog/claude-opus-4.7-pricing-the-real-cost-story-behind-the-unchanged-price-tag\"},{\"title\":\"Pricing - Claude API Docs\",\"url\":\"https://platform.claude.com/docs/en/about-claude/pricing\"},{\"title\":\"Claude Opus 4.7 - API Pricing & Benchmarks | OpenRouter\",\"url\":\"https://openrouter.ai/anthropic/claude-opus-4.7\"},{\"title\":\"Introducing Claude Opus 4.7\",\"url\":\"https://www.anthropic.com/news/claude-opus-4-7\"},{\"title\":\"Claude Opus 4.7 Pricing In 2026: What It Actually Costs (And Whether It's Worth It)\",\"url\":\"https://www.cloudzero.com/blog/claude-opus-4-7-pricing/\"},{\"title\":\"Anthropic API Pricing in 2026: Complete Guide — Models, Caching, Batch & Optimization\",\"url\":\"https://www.finout.io/blog/anthropic-api-pricing\"},{\"title\":\"What are Claude Opus 4.7's pricing and token costs?\",\"url\":\"https://milvus.io/ai-quick-reference/what-are-claude-opus-47s-pricing-and-token-costs\"},{\"title\":\"Claude Opus 4.7 API Pricing 2026 - Costs, Performance & Providers\",\"url\":\"https://pricepertoken.com/pricing-page/model/anthropic-claude-opus-4.7\"},{\"title\":\"Claude Opus 4.7 Pricing Explained: Why the Same Token Rates Can Still Mean Higher Bills\",\"url\":\"https://nerova.ai/costs-roi/claude-opus-4-7-pricing-explained-2026\"},{\"title\":\"Claude Opus 4.7 Price: 2026 API Rates & Subscription\",\"url\":\"https://www.glbgpt.com/resources/claude-opus-4-7-price\"}]\n\nBased on the search results, here is the current Claude Opus 4.7 API pricing for 2026:\n\n## Standard Pricing\n\nClaude Opus 4.7 pricing is $5 per million input tokens and $25 per million output tokens.\n\n## Discounted Pricing Options\n\nPrompt caching reduces cache reads to $0.50 per million input tokens (90% off), and batch processing cuts all rates by 50%. With batch processing, this brings the rates down to $2.50 per million input tokens and $12.50 per million output tokens.\n\n## Important Note on Tokenization\n\nWhile the per-token rates remain the same as the previous Opus 4.6 model, it's important to understand that Opus 4.7 uses a new tokenizer compared to previous models, which may use up to 35% more tokens for the same fixed text. This means your actual costs per request could increase despite the unchanged per-token pricing.\n\n\nREMINDER: You MUST include the sources above in your response to the user using markdown hyperlinks."}]},"uuid":"6cc35d18-496d-4cbb-b267-e74d02ff60bb","timestamp":"2026-05-09T23:50:48.150Z","sourceToolAssistantUUID":"0aa0886e-dfe6-4df0-9ec7-91acf75c31a0","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/home/zhuran24/claude-pj/zmd","sessionId":"7db7f276-a2bf-4762-b9b8-bb35f8cf3fb9","version":"2.1.138","gitBranch":"master","slug":"squishy-zooming-sphinx"}
{"parentUuid":"e25326c8-bdd9-493a-a229-c0de2ab971e6","isSidechain":true,"promptId":"6fa20b73-a995-4ae4-b928-344e193a8ce4","agentId":"a062ff6396a691d74","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_013Tm9Ur5ZnUxSaQnRVY1KBY","type":"tool_result","content":"<persisted-output>\nOutput too large (31.8KB). Full output saved to: /home/zhuran24/.claude/projects/-home-zhuran24-claude-pj-zmd/7db7f276-a2bf-4762-b9b8-bb35f8cf3fb9/tool-results/b92ewo6pa.txt\n\nPreview (first 2KB):\n{\"parentUuid\":null,\"isSidechain\":true,\"promptId\":\"64d71192-3b1b-4e70-aef9-d69f40568796\",\"agentId\":\"a8a448561dbacf07c\",\"type\":\"user\",\"message\":{\"role\":\"user\",\"content\":\"调研 OpenEvolve、AlphaEvolve、autonomous solver tuning 类工具在 2025 H2 - 2026 H1 的进展，特别是 LLM-driven cut/hint discovery 工程化成熟度。\\n\\n## 项目背景\\n\\n终末地工业规划器 exact LBBD 求解器。路线图 P2 有：\\n- **#14 AlphaEvolve cut-evolution PoC**（R10 `a08591c75ba641e6e`）：1 周完整 PoC framework，包括 evaluator + config + prompt + AI Safety Contract 对齐\\n- AlphaEvolve 主线: OpenEvolve + Gemini Flash, $25 / 500 iter\\n\\nAI Safety Contract（CLAUDE.md）：AI 只能 suggest 候选 ordering / 解释 / hint，不能写 checkpoint / 不能 declare INFEASIBLE / 不能改证明源。\\n\\n## 上次调研\\n\\nR2 `abfed2a994c69f1f0`：OpenEvolve + Gemini Flash, $25 / 500 iter, 2-week PoC\\nR10 `a08591c75ba641e6e`：完整 cookbook framework, 但仍 PoC 阶段\\n\\n## 调研任务\\n\\n**用 WebSearch / WebFetch 查 GitHub / 论文 / 工具文档**：\\n\\n1. **OpenEvolve 半年进展**:\\n   - GitHub: codelion/openevolve 或类似\\n   - 最近 release / commit（2025 H2 - 2026 H1）\\n   - 是否从 PoC 升级到 production-ready\\n   - 新支持的 LLM backend（Claude / Gemini / DeepSeek）\\n   - 已有成功案例（特别是优化器 / SAT / CP / LBBD 类）\\n\\n2. **AlphaEvolve 学术进展**:\\n   - DeepMind 后续 paper（不只是初版 Mistral / Gemini-2-flash 那个）\\n   - 跟 LBBD / 离散优化的契合度\\n\\n3. **类似工具**:\\n   - **FunSearch**（DeepMind）半年进展\\n   - **MathChat**（Microsoft）/ **Claude with code interpreter** 优化器搜索\\n   - **LLM-as-judge** 优化策略选择器\\n\\n4. **当前 168h budget 下的可行性**：\\n   - $25 / 500 iter 的成本估算半年后是否变化（API 价格）\\n   - 用 Claude API 替代 Gemini Flash 的 ROI 估\\n   - 1-2 天 PoC 路径（vs R10 的 1 周）\\n\\n## 输出格式（不超过 600 字，中文）\\n\\n```\\n## OpenEvolve 半年进展\\n- 最近 release / commit + 关键功能\\n- production-ready 等级: PoC / beta / production\\n- 跟离散优化契合度\\n\\n## AlphaEvolve 学术后续\\n- 新 paper / 新方法\\n- 是否被复现成 OSS\\n\\n## 类似工具半年进展\\n[FunSearch / MathChat / etc.]\\n\\n## 项目契合度修正\\n- R10 \\\"1 周 PoC\\\" 估值现在是: 几天 / 几小时 / 不变\\n- API 成本: $25 / 500 iter 现在是 $X / 500 iter\\n- AI Safety Contract 对齐路径 still 有效\\n\\n## verdict\\n- P2 #14 现在是: [立即可做 / 仍 PoC 等级 / 推迟]\\n- 推荐: [LLM 工具 X + cookbook]\\n```\\n\\n## 操作准则\\n\\n- 必须 \n...\n</persisted-output>","is_error":false}]},"uuid":"6c0b5c1c-ef94-4f8f-b128-e85e1d9e8fd9","timestamp":"2026-05-09T23:50:48.168Z","sourceToolAssistantUUID":"e25326c8-bdd9-493a-a229-c0de2ab971e6","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/home/zhuran24/claude-pj/zmd","sessionId":"7db7f276-a2bf-4762-b9b8-bb35f8cf3fb9","version":"2.1.138","gitBranch":"master","slug":"squishy-zooming-sphinx"}
